# The checkout root ignores every directory named `lib/`, which covers the upstream fixtures under
# tests/fixtures/*/lib. `analyze` walks fixtures with gitignore semantics, so those units must stay
# visible to git and to the walkers. Keep the negation on `lib` alone: a blanket
# `!tests/fixtures/**` would also re-include `tests/fixtures/**/node_modules`, which the tests create.
!tests/fixtures/**/lib/
!tests/fixtures/**/lib/**
